    "name": "zoomies",
    "steam_appid": 3009430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/a6d1b7fbbe85492f4121f0b6e078ad52.avif?t=1734614083\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash your cunning in Zoomies, a social deduction TPS game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends at our theme park and dive into the wild excitement of Zoomies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt [life-like mechanical animals] wildly darting around, and uncover the hidden roles of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key is simple: don\u2019t lose your focus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/77998c980674cfd7afef9522e023c83e.poster.avif?t=1734614083\" width=680 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/77998c980674cfd7afef9522e023c83e.webm?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/77998c980674cfd7afef9522e023c83e.mp4?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t let other players out of your sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/5f073aa497520299d3af14cdd7339506.avif?t=1734614083\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Character!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/a46a5facd75978b412cca8414f87f9d8.poster.avif?t=1734614083\" width=758 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/a46a5facd75978b412cca8414f87f9d8.webm?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/a46a5facd75978b412cca8414f87f9d8.mp4?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your personality!<br>Create a unique style for your in-game character and stand out with your own flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with Friends!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/36e730cc5bc9937a7d55d29aaaf2b475.poster.avif?t=1734614083\" width=776 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/36e730cc5bc9937a7d55d29aaaf2b475.webm?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/36e730cc5bc9937a7d55d29aaaf2b475.mp4?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends for even more fun and fierce competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZOOMIES</strong> is a multiplayer game where the excitement multiplies when you play together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Your Role!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/c1f30126a807c7bb95c3f23a8921d02e.poster.avif?t=1734614083\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/c1f30126a807c7bb95c3f23a8921d02e.webm?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/c1f30126a807c7bb95c3f23a8921d02e.mp4?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player is assigned a secret <strong>role</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These roles are the key to collecting animals and earning points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your role hidden from others\u2014you\u2019ll find out why soon enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt with Thrills!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/786659353be425f6398aed2e78aed1e4.poster.avif?t=1734614083\" width=796 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/786659353be425f6398aed2e78aed1e4.webm?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/786659353be425f6398aed2e78aed1e4.mp4?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase and capture animals rushing into the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return them to score points! Completing specific combinations will earn you bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, the highest score might not always mean victory. Hide your <strong>role</strong> and carefully <strong>observe others</strong> to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guess the Roles of Others!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/145b8767e8ef82f4bad1d253248ad77f.poster.avif?t=1734614083\" width=776 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/145b8767e8ef82f4bad1d253248ad77f.webm?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/145b8767e8ef82f4bad1d253248ad77f.mp4?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your observations and try to deduce other players' roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess correctly, and you\u2019ll strip them of their bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right deduction could secure your victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/a6d1b7fbbe85492f4121f0b6e078ad52.avif?t=1734614083\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash your cunning in Zoomies, a social deduction TPS game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends at our theme park and dive into the wild excitement of Zoomies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt [life-like mechanical animals] wildly darting around, and uncover the hidden roles of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key is simple: don\u2019t lose your focus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/77998c980674cfd7afef9522e023c83e.poster.avif?t=1734614083\" width=680 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/77998c980674cfd7afef9522e023c83e.webm?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/77998c980674cfd7afef9522e023c83e.mp4?t=1734614083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t let other players out of your sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/5f073aa497520299d3af14cdd7339506.avif?t=1734614083\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Character!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009430/extras/a46a5facd75978b412cc